<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine launched a large drone barrage that struck the Crimea bridge, temporarily halting traffic. Moscow said it will not dictate the participation of an EU delegation in Ukraine talks. Estonia summoned a Russian diplomat after accusing Russia of a sabotage attempt on a drone manufacturer and then shut all its border crossings with Russia. There were 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261116-ukraine-hits-key-crimea-bridge-with-drones&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/4d014005-1a99-4e3e-88d5-b116fe2497bc?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168807&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/moscow-says-it-will-not-dictate-eu-delegations-participation-in-ukraine-talks&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/us-floats-ukraine-ceding-land-to-russia-in-exchange-for-nato-membership-zelenskyy&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261117-trump-asia-nuclear-talks-china-russia&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/e567ba7d-c53a-47a2-a361-3b8a107fcdef?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQTEZvZ1pFSGNkdXh4bXdESEZXLVpHdHFIMWJnd0VLVDhrMHBaUVF3c2VHNVZEOU95cWk1UzE5RWFyQmJFLUFfTjlEbzRteXBOa0RVdFFtTzdQN183V2htYzBMSGprcEZQVHdWTDgzbnRpY1pSUjhpeW5adklHMU02VDFfZkhTQUNoZEhkSEZ3TXU3cWw5VExLdHRJRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNdzhfNmhQb1EzcVB3YWdhNVRmRDVHSzAxdnBqLWZpY0xYNVB6UnAxX005aU5wQnpzeGdrTmt3dDRwWWVkVGRyNkgzMTE0Q